    "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716930/extras/5f1f7db2b6e4c65bf8ef0b675d5b8a7b.avif?t=1745906995\" width=616 height=1084 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pleases follow us and add the The Emperor and State to your wishlist! Your support is the greatest motivation for game development!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >English localization is still in progress. <strong>We expect to provide English support in the update after the release of the Early Access version.</strong> We sincerely ask for your understanding and patience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716930/extras/d2e1fc8aeeee0edc4484f390624ba6c5.avif?t=1745906995\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Emperor and the State is a simulation game that combines elements of strategy, management, development, and collection. Players will portray ancient Chinese monarchs, governing the country, collecting renowned ministers and consorts from various eras, nurturing descendants, and ultimately building an enduring empire through generations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716930/extras/8e2f42ab67487ecad077b51f7713c086.avif?t=1745906995\" width=616 height=134 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716930/extras/529ac39c12b88aaadb02cf9e5596f744.avif?t=1745906995\" width=616 height=353 /></span>Conduct court sessions, handle memorials, and set national policies. The State includes over 20 different Indicators that interdepend and influence each other. By  adjusting the relationships between these Indicators, stabilize and promote the development of the nation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716930/extras/9a3651ce0c882f3bc90ca4848d7fb3ff.avif?t=1745906995\" width=616 height=353 /></span>Issue decrees, contemplate strategies, appoint officials, and enforce decrees. Decrees are categorized into seven major types, requiring issuance by the Secretaries of the six Ministry: Personnel, Revenue, Rites, Military, Punishment, and Public Works, as well as the Prime Minister. These decrees contribute to the governance and development of the nation, with most requiring cooperation between the Emperor and ministers through policy proposals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716930/extras/03a78015d5588d3abace5abd782a6543.avif?t=1745906995\" width=616 height=353 /></span>Making distant friends while attacking nearby in diplomacy. Send envoys to other countries, establish trade relationships, or initiate wars...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716930/extras/931d4d12b8179d2e6bfeee6ccc0dced1.avif?t=1745906995\" width=616 height=353 /></span>Train soldiers, prepare military supplies. When the time is right, seize cities and conquer territories. Influence the course of war by issuing military commands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716930/extras/0cfd7dcf8f76220210205e9428c81bef.avif?t=1745906995\" width=616 height=134 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716930/extras/296239d2143e0b69f5b539e47434666a.avif?t=1745906995\" width=616 height=353 /></span>Promote education, advance imperial examinations, and gather talented ministers. Through the annual imperial exams and additional special exams, collect historically outstanding ministers and employ them according to their abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716930/extras/a79bd06746486484a6f748118c5a94a8.avif?t=1745906995\" width=616 height=134 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716930/extras/9c3f998702e46fc9922cd9ff19d2535c.avif?t=1745906995\" width=616 height=353 /></span>The Emperor possesses four attributes: governance, benevolence, valor, and talent. Engage in self-cultivation within various facilities in the imperial palace to enhance corresponding attributes. The Emperor's personal attributes greatly influence the efficiency of governance; therefore, properly schedule daily activities to exercise and improve oneself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716930/extras/9f9d5bf1ffdad58b0c40b42122c3e746.avif?t=1745906995\" width=616 height=134 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716930/extras/6b86f4072934e4322f63e765210fe782.avif?t=1745906995\" width=616 height=353 /></span>Gather beauties, bestow favor in the six palaces, and enjoy worldly splendor. Confer titles in the harem, bear imperial heirs, and relax to increase efficiency in other matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716930/extras/7beef9d713fc9cf458df500dcd6bb911.avif?t=1745906995\" width=616 height=134 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716930/extras/aaf1e69cc086515596cc5406acf22da5.avif?t=1745906995\" width=616 height=353 /></span>The Emperor is also mortal, and life has its limits. Choose the most talented prince in advance and focus on their cultivation. After the current Emperor's passing, the imperial heir will ascend the throne, and the game will continue! Through generations of inheritance, create your everlasting empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716930/extras/8a93768f5b59cf9ef900dd408ed510e6.avif?t=1745906995\" width=616 height=134 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716930/extras/1c82795c1390555e84d1c4f9fb4fd487.poster.avif?t=1745906995\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716930/extras/1c82795c1390555e84d1c4f9fb4fd487.webm?t=1745906995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716930/extras/1c82795c1390555e84d1c4f9fb4fd487.mp4?t=1745906995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Through generations of inheritance, developing national strength, expanding territories, ultimately creating your eternal empire.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pleases follow us and add the The Emperor and State to your wishlist! Your support is the greatest motivation for game development!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >English localization is still in progress. <strong>We expect to provide English support in the update after the release of the Early Access version.</strong> We sincerely ask for your understanding and patience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716930/extras/d2e1fc8aeeee0edc4484f390624ba6c5.avif?t=1745906995\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Emperor and the State is a simulation game that combines elements of strategy, management, development, and collection. Players will portray ancient Chinese monarchs, governing the country, collecting renowned ministers and consorts from various eras, nurturing descendants, and ultimately building an enduring empire through generations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716930/extras/8e2f42ab67487ecad077b51f7713c086.avif?t=1745906995\" width=616 height=134 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716930/extras/529ac39c12b88aaadb02cf9e5596f744.avif?t=1745906995\" width=616 height=353 /></span>Conduct court sessions, handle memorials, and set national policies. The State includes over 20 different Indicators that interdepend and influence each other. By  adjusting the relationships between these Indicators, stabilize and promote the development of the nation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716930/extras/9a3651ce0c882f3bc90ca4848d7fb3ff.avif?t=1745906995\" width=616 height=353 /></span>Issue decrees, contemplate strategies, appoint officials, and enforce decrees. Decrees are categorized into seven major types, requiring issuance by the Secretaries of the six Ministry: Personnel, Revenue, Rites, Military, Punishment, and Public Works, as well as the Prime Minister. These decrees contribute to the governance and development of the nation, with most requiring cooperation between the Emperor and ministers through policy proposals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716930/extras/03a78015d5588d3abace5abd782a6543.avif?t=1745906995\" width=616 height=353 /></span>Making distant friends while attacking nearby in diplomacy. Send envoys to other countries, establish trade relationships, or initiate wars...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716930/extras/931d4d12b8179d2e6bfeee6ccc0dced1.avif?t=1745906995\" width=616 height=353 /></span>Train soldiers, prepare military supplies. When the time is right, seize cities and conquer territories. Influence the course of war by issuing military commands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716930/extras/0cfd7dcf8f76220210205e9428c81bef.avif?t=1745906995\" width=616 height=134 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716930/extras/296239d2143e0b69f5b539e47434666a.avif?t=1745906995\" width=616 height=353 /></span>Promote education, advance imperial examinations, and gather talented ministers. Through the annual imperial exams and additional special exams, collect historically outstanding ministers and employ them according to their abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716930/extras/a79bd06746486484a6f748118c5a94a8.avif?t=1745906995\" width=616 height=134 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716930/extras/9c3f998702e46fc9922cd9ff19d2535c.avif?t=1745906995\" width=616 height=353 /></span>The Emperor possesses four attributes: governance, benevolence, valor, and talent. Engage in self-cultivation within various facilities in the imperial palace to enhance corresponding attributes. The Emperor's personal attributes greatly influence the efficiency of governance; therefore, properly schedule daily activities to exercise and improve oneself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716930/extras/9f9d5bf1ffdad58b0c40b42122c3e746.avif?t=1745906995\" width=616 height=134 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716930/extras/6b86f4072934e4322f63e765210fe782.avif?t=1745906995\" width=616 height=353 /></span>Gather beauties, bestow favor in the six palaces, and enjoy worldly splendor. Confer titles in the harem, bear imperial heirs, and relax to increase efficiency in other matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716930/extras/7beef9d713fc9cf458df500dcd6bb911.avif?t=1745906995\" width=616 height=134 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716930/extras/aaf1e69cc086515596cc5406acf22da5.avif?t=1745906995\" width=616 height=353 /></span>The Emperor is also mortal, and life has its limits. Choose the most talented prince in advance and focus on their cultivation. After the current Emperor's passing, the imperial heir will ascend the throne, and the game will continue! Through generations of inheritance, create your everlasting empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716930/extras/8a93768f5b59cf9ef900dd408ed510e6.avif?t=1745906995\" width=616 height=134 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716930/extras/1c82795c1390555e84d1c4f9fb4fd487.poster.avif?t=1745906995\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716930/extras/1c82795c1390555e84d1c4f9fb4fd487.webm?t=1745906995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716930/extras/1c82795c1390555e84d1c4f9fb4fd487.mp4?t=1745906995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Through generations of inheritance, developing national strength, expanding territories, ultimately creating your eternal empire.</p>",
